{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12301770","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12301770","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1230177001:1":{"text":"좋고 나쁨을 따지면 나쁘지... 일자리도, 먹을 것도 없지만 블러디 로즈가 싫어서 가입한 녀석들이 많았어. 서로 돌봐주면서 지냈기 때문에 나는 좋아해.","source_cn":"好还是不好……很多人都是没活干、没吃的，不服血薇帮才加...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC25F1C3493B910A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230177002:1":{"text":"하지만 죽음의 함대는 다른 얘기야... 우리는 살고 싶었을 뿐인데, 죽음의 함대는 그런 걸 전혀 상관하지 않았어.","source_cn":"但是，死潮舰队就是另一回事了……我们只想活着，但死潮舰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3C4294A7A3AE8E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230177003:1":{"text":"결국 이 부두로 돌아온 건 나 혼자뿐이네.","source_cn":"最终回到这个码头的，竟然只剩下我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29527F78C82DFC38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230177004:1":{"text":"지금 생각해 보니 치카바처럼 머뭇거리는 게 나쁘지만은 않은 것 같아.","source_cn":"现在看起来，像奇卡瓦这样犹豫，或许也并不是坏事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x142D0CD586FD772A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:水鬼帮威特":{"text":"물귀신파 위트","source":"水鬼帮威特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}